Copyright 2026 Vadym Chernets

This product includes software developed by Vadym Chernets, as part of Poly A1.

The six measurements of a pilot (time, quality, coverage, repeatability, new capability, what a person
checks) and the key number "minutes of human help per successful first artifact" come from the Poly A1
author's own pilot plan (2026-09-19). "termboost" - the same task once in the app and once in the
terminal, then again with one command - is an idea from the council run for the Poly A1 track for
companies (2026-10-02), built here as `teamcall boost`. The daily cards in the messenger the employee
already has, with nothing to install, teaching how to lead an agent and approve its steps, come from the
Poly A1 phone research (2026-10-03), built here as `teamcall lesson`.

